<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on the MDAX index.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on the MDAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) GmbH has issued 10 million European-style capped call warrants, on the MDAX index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,300.00 DEM	    CAP	    3,500 DEM</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.54 DEM</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3470.00 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  DBWA59</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
